Feature: The queue of a drone
  A commander can give a drone a [[queue]] with its order. The queue is a list of up to four
  instructions. Each one has an order and the condition that starts it. The condition is one of
  three: the drone has been out of contact for some seconds, the order before it is done, or
  the [[battery]] of the drone is down to some seconds.

  A [[standing order]] is a queue of one instruction. The queue is for a plan that has more
  steps: take a tower, then take the next one, then go home.

  A drone takes the instructions of its queue only when it is out of contact. In contact, the
  commander gives the orders. A drone in contact keeps its order. An order is done when the drone
  sees that it is done: a drone that takes a tower is done when its own camera sees that its team
  holds the tower. A drone that goes to a point is done when it is there. A drone that holds, circles or goes home is
  never done.

  A drone that has started on its queue stays on its order, also when it is in contact again,
  until the commander gives it a new order. A drone with no queue flies home when its link is
  lost: see [[Standing orders]].

  Expectation: A drone out of contact works down its queue
    The first instruction is due 5 s after the link is cut. The drone sees that its team holds
    the east tower, so the second instruction starts.

    Given the centre tower is held by Red
    And the towers held by Blue are 2
    And the west tower is neutral
    And the east tower is held by Blue
    And the order that the first Blue drone flies is take the centre tower
    And the queue of the first Blue drone is take the east tower after 5 s, then take the west tower when done
    And the first Blue drone is 190 m from the centre tower
    When the game runs for 10 seconds
    Then the order that the first Blue drone flies is take the west tower

  Expectation: A drone waits for the order before an instruction to be done
    The east tower is not held by Blue. The order to take it is not done.

    Given the centre tower is held by Red
    And the east tower is neutral
    And the order that the first Blue drone flies is take the centre tower
    And the queue of the first Blue drone is take the east tower after 5 s, then go home when done
    And the first Blue drone is 190 m from the centre tower
    When the game runs for 10 seconds
    Then the order that the first Blue drone flies is take the east tower

  Expectation: A drone that is done with its queue flies home
    The last instruction of the queue is to go home. This is the end of every queue.

    Given the centre tower is held by Red
    And the towers held by Blue are 2
    And the west tower is neutral
    And the east tower is held by Blue
    And the order that the first Blue drone flies is take the centre tower
    And the queue of the first Blue drone is take the east tower after 5 s, then go home when done
    And the first Blue drone is 190 m from the centre tower
    When the game runs for 10 seconds
    Then the order that the first Blue drone flies is go home

  Expectation: An order is done when the camera of the drone sees that it is done
    The drone is far from the east tower, and its camera does not see it. Its team holds the east
    tower, but the drone does not know it.

    Given the Red home tower is held by Red
    And the towers held by Blue are 2
    And the west tower is neutral
    And the east tower is held by Blue
    And the order that the first Blue drone flies is take the east tower
    And the queue of the first Blue drone is go home when done
    And the first Blue drone is near the Red home tower
    When the game runs for 10 seconds
    Then the order that the first Blue drone flies is take the east tower

  Expectation: A drone starts an instruction when its battery is low
    Overrides: A drone out of contact keeps its order until the standing order is due
    The instruction starts when the battery is down to 80 s, 10 s before the drone has to go home.

    Given the batteries are on
    And the Red home tower is held by Red
    And the order that the first Blue drone flies is take the west tower
    And the queue of the first Blue drone is hold at 80 s of battery
    And the battery of the first Blue drone is 70 s
    And the first Blue drone is near the Red home tower
    When the game runs for 3 seconds
    Then the order that the first Blue drone flies is hold

  Expectation: A new order replaces the queue
    Given the order that the first Blue drone flies is take the west tower
    And the queue of the first Blue drone is hold after 5 s, then go home when done
    When the first Blue drone is given the order to hold
    Then the queue of the first Blue drone is none

  Expectation: A queue has at most four instructions
    Given the order that the first Blue drone flies is take the west tower
    When the first Blue drone is given the order to hold with a queue of five instructions
    Then the number of instructions in the queue of the first Blue drone is 4
